00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.290
<v Speaker 2>It's news to me. Like, I don't know any of the archetypes. So</v>

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:42.800
<v Speaker 2>like my biggest strength in Magic up to this point was being able to anticipate what cards were gonna come from my opponents and even getting to the point where I could narrow down what cards they had in their hand at the moment.</v>

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:47.870
<v Speaker 2>I can't do that now. Like it's taking my biggest strength and totally removed it, so</v>

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.050
<v Speaker 2>I'm kind of flying by the seat of my pants.</v>

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:55.120
<v Speaker 1>Alright, well see, your pants have taken you very far thus far and I hope they take a little further, so congratulations.</v>

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.050
<v Speaker 2>Thank you very much.</v>

